msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Now flush that relationship away!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a strange rapper standing in your bathroom where the toilet usually is—he's dressed in white and gold, but where his outfit is clean, the look he gives you is downright dirty."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "While you might be curious about this toilet-man it seems more than clear that curiosity doesn't go both ways."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... you're the toilet, huh? What's that like?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I gotta pee. Open up."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-0/c-2/7 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The toilet-man springs into action, raising his hands to his mouth as he begins to beat-box."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-0/c-2/15 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-0/c-3/15 jeanloo_toilet/toilet_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>(Beat-boxing)</i>"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ Little Crapper the rapper he knows how to go! / Plumbing and drumming are both about flow! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ You block his pipes he'll be ending your life when he slams your head into the bowl! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ OH! On a (toilet) roll! Jean Loo Pissoir, out of control! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ Over? Under? Never blunder! Spittin' more words than an ancient scroll. ♪ Ha hah!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holy crap."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh SHIT, son! That was dope!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "No, no. Holy Crap was Jean Loo's old stage name. Now he is... Lil' Crapper. More secular, ah? Ehh... wider appeal, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Do not say dope to Lil' Crapper! Dope is what the junkies hide in the cisterns of innocent toilets like Jean Loo."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo sings all about this in Lil' Crapper's latest album, the TP-EP."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Anyway, you know Lil' Crapper. You love him, everybody does."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ You come to hear his beats, eh? Or maybe you ate a pizz-a? D'jou come to take a seat so you can deposit the foods you eat, eh? ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-2/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... no. Just wanted to get to know you better."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-2/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. Absolutely I am here to listen to the beats."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ \"To know me\"? \"To know me\"?! This human thinks that they own me! / There's always one thing on my mind, and always one thing only! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ I'm a rapper! The best you've seen, a shining dream in por-ce-leen! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ He's like a bidet only spitting the truth. / Going down quicker than gin and vermouth. / They call him a pottymouth / Letting the naughty out / But that's the way to appeal to the youth. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Consider me appealed to."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's... nice."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Maaaan, you ain't the \"youth\", get out of here! Lil' Crapper can't hang with posers, you know? It hurts his image!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "If you are a poser, you get out of Lil' Crapper's face."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not a poser."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You callin' me old?!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Eh... maybe? Show me what you got! Show me! Show me Lil' Crapper is not alone on this stage of tile and stone!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You want me to rap?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I'll rap you up and put you away!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Is not nice. It is the best. Because Lil' Crapper is the best!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You want to be like Lil' Crapper? You want to meet him on his level? You want others to love you like they love him?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/23
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>Impossible!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/31
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "The ladies love nobody as much as him! The amount of ass he gets would make you weep!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/39
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "...In fact, it is not just the lady asses. Lil' Crapper accepts any ass. He is not picky. He accommodates."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/47
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "But some! Some do not accommodate. These are the people he has no time for."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/55
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Those who don't understand his syncopated singing? They do their business. They leave. He does not talk to them."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/63
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You want to hang with Lil' Crapper? You do as he does!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/71/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I will rap. I am the best at rap."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-3/c-9/71/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't rap!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/jeanloo_meeting_crapping/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Not just rap! You need to show him that you can crap!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/jeanloo_meeting_crapping/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...Excuse me?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/jeanloo_meeting_crapping/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...I mean, I might get performance anxiety, but I'll try..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/jeanloo_meeting_crapping/c-10/13
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Crap! Crapping! Short for \"Cool-Rapping\". Lil' Crapper is always crapping. Now it's your turn!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/jeanloo_meeting_crapping/c-11/13
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You misunderstand him! CRAPPING! Short for \"Cool-Rapping\". Lil' Crapper is always crapping. Now it's your turn!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/jeanloo_meeting_crapping/c-11/21
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Show him! Show him you can crap!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think people will interpret that the way that you want them to."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just here because I'm crap at dating..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Jean Loo makes a dismissive gesture."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-12/18
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "That is their problem! Lil' Crapper? He is ahead of the curve. He is a wordsmith, eh? He is like Voltaire! French and smarter than you!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-12/26
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "On a related note: \"Bowl-taire\" was my number two pick for my nom de plume."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Dating?!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/21
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo is an expert on dating! He has gone on many dates! So many!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/29
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Do not ask anyone else in the house to verify this!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/40
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo knows the key to dating... is to wow the other party."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/48
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ The ladies, gentlemen, and those between / Will be hanging off your arm in a limousine / Provided you can preen / If you can caterwaul / But without rapping you will not be dating at all! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/59/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You think I need to rap to get a date?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/59/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you trying to bait me into a rap battle?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/59/c-0/7 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-4/c-13/59/c-1/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>Oui.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How am I gonna learn how to rap?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-5/c-14/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Not from Lil' Crapper."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-6/0/s/0 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/50/s/0 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_out/0/c-1/19/c-0/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Lil' Crapper is not a teacher. He is the TEST!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You study on your own time. You cannot keep up? You fail."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "But! If you can match his rapping skill, then you will be able to woo anybody!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "If you have the skills to woo Lil' Crapper, than any partner will be within your reach! In fact, if you can match Lil' Crapper in a crap battle, then he will fall in love with you!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there any other way?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But all I've ever wanted is a pasty narcissist bolted to the bathroom floor!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/c-17/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Enough!! Lil' Crapper can sense you are unable to hold back your passion for crap any longer!!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-7/c-18/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Cease your flattery! Lil' Crapper's heart is immune to all forms of romance unless they are accompanied by a backing beat."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "So! What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Do you have what it takes to face Jean Loo?!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/16/s/0 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-6/64/s/0 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_2nd_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/17/s/0 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-6/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/c-19/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You are WRONG!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/c-19/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo knows you. You are the shut-in. The kissless loser."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/c-19/23
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You have enthusiasm for rap... Lil' Crapper sees this. But enthusiasm alone... she is not enough!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/c-20/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Correct!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-8/c-20/18
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo is glad you understand this."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-9/4
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "The rapping, she comes from the heart. The deepest part of the cistern!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-9/12
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Like that little rubber bit that comes undone sometimes and the water keeps running forever. You know the bit."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-9/20
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You need to experience life before you can spit it out in alternating phonemes adhering to some sort of rhyme structure!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-9/28
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "As you are, you have no chance to defeat Jean Loo, let alone match his rapier wit."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-9/36
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You want to clash talons with this two-gallon stallion? Go! Live a life worth rapping about."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_meeting/0/g-9/44
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Return to Lil' Crapper... when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You are back! Are you ready to begin the test of rhyming? Or are you willing to die alone?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Though... that red shirt... c'est fantastique..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/8/b/9
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "No matter!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'm ready."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/c-0/7 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_3/0/jeanloo_crapbattle_3a/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "C'es parti!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_1st_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Then do not waste Lil' Crapper's time, eh!? Get out of here! Come back when you are done with being the worst!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/4
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Okay. You have returned in time for... The first test."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/12
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "This will be a baby game for babies so Lil' Crapper can make sure you are not a little baby who he hates. Babies are for diapers, they are not ready for Lil' Crapper."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/20
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Babies have trouble filling their lines in the choices below, they only have so many words before they fill the box, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean? I have as many words as I want to fill the box I'll never run out right? Oh I guess this is starting to add up after a while, and if I were to rap it would be even more... oh snap... I see w"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're the one who's a freaking toilet-themed rapper which is worse than a baby according to recent reports. How dare you say that my little dialogue box is too small! You're the one who is small minded, not m"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It may be about the size of the box, but my box is totally the right size my guy. Maybe you just can't handle my enormous box with the tiny text? Do you feel intimidated by my big box that cannot lie? Is tha"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's no way I'm reading what's in this dialogue box. It's a complete waste of time and I'm definitely not picking this option because it's stupid. It's a bad choice. It probably leads to an instant hate endi"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "See? Look how tiny your presence is! A rapper needs big presence - they need to SHOUT!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Luckily Lil' Crapper has an assistant for someone with a little baby voice like you."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "This..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Is BALLCOCK!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Jean Loo holds a strangely mic-shaped object in his hands—it's round and black and almost balloon-like. You're sure you've seen it before, but where..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "WHAT DID YOU SAY"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh sure. This is my life now. I won't question it."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/c-4/7 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You know! The part of the toilet in the cistern - it is like a floating ball."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/c-4/15 jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "That is the literal name of it!!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Look at Lil' Crappers mighty hand - watch him stroke his own ballcock as he sings!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Put it near your mouth and witness!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not doing that."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, here goes."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Ballcock"
msgid "I'm not doing that."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_crapbattle_1/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Ballcock"
