#: jeanloo_toilet/toilet_lovereturn/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ A rattle and binky are just what you'll need / A bottle to pop in your jaws of defeat! / I think maybe this <i>bébé</i>, they should've abstained! / Now open wide, child, 'cause here comes the pain! ♪"
