#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You fling Jean Loo's heart around like the goldfish in a bowl."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Swirling down the drain like the parent who feeds too many of the goldfish flakes..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You return? Are you equipped to make Jean Loo a Jean Loo-man now? (NOTE: Jean Loo but human)"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I am equipped."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still not yet."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Ah! Jean Loo's heart - She sinks, like yet another goldfish flown into the bowl, with no ballcock to keep it buoyant."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_begin/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "To be human..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_begin/8
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Oh, to only be shit on metaphorically instead of literally! Jean Loo... he weeps at the prospect."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_begin/22/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm a little nervous about making something Realized, but..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_begin/25
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I will not question your choice to turn this toilet into a living human man."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realize_begin/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a toilet, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Oh, hoh ho!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "OH HOH HOH HOH HOH!!!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/25
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo... he lives! And after all these years, he can finally turn around!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He turns around."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/41
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Eugh! Look at this! Is this what you let accumulate behind Jean Loo? The dust bunnies and a crinkly old dryer sheet?!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/49
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "The only thing hanging on Jean Loo's shoulder should be the beautiful groupies!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I could oblige."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll be rolling in groupies soon enough."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/14
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Oh ho! A partner in the sheets as well as the beats!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/22
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo, he knows how well you handle his ballcock. You are well equipped."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/30
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "However, I have... seen more than enough of your nether regions for one lifetime. And I have seen the worst of them."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/38
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "But perhaps... the kiss? Yes?"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lean forward and kiss Jean Loo."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/57
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The moment your lips lock, you regret it."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/65
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Jean Loo's breath is, predictably, not great. The taste of his mouth is even worse. You think back and try to remember the last time you cleaned him with a toilet brush."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/70
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Well? How was it? That was Jean Loo's first kiss. And if you tell him he did a bad job, he will cry!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You look deep into his big, sad, wet eyes."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Despite all the wordsmith training you've done together, you do not know what to say."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But in no time, Jean Loo does."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/c-0/102
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He begins thinking of his future, and holds court with you on the bed."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/0
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo can see it now..."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/8
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "He will have the moderate success with his first few songs. The second album, she will be even better!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/16
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "But the third album... this is the one that changes everything!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/24
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Jean Loo is noticed by the big-time producer. He guests on two songs, one of which becomes the number one jam due to his lyrical stylings!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/32
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Soon enough, he rockets up the charts!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/40
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Platinum! Triple platinum! A new rank called Porcelain, just for Jean Loo!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/48
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "The fame gets to Jean Loo though. He becomes embroiled in an East Coast-West Coast rap beef with his ultimate rival: Jimmy Bidet."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/56
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Tensions grow higher and higher. Rumors abound of Lil' Crapper's vices and addictions. His life is in shambles, but the songs keep on coming!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/64
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Then, at the height of it all, he is taken out in a drive-by-shitting. The other Coast had enough of him."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/72
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "His death comes as a shock to the nation. People speculate over his killing for years. There are some who say, Jean Loo... he is still out there."
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/80
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>Au revoir, mon ami.</i> Jean Loo's new life. She begin today!"
msgstr ""

#: jeanloo_toilet/jeanloo_realized/0/jeanjoin/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Jean Loo became an accountant."
msgstr ""
